OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AVeterans gather ahead of two-minute
OL,4,Asilence at Remembrance Sunday service
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome 10,000 armed forces veterans will
OL,7,Ftake part in the Royal British Legion's
OL,8,Fmarch-past through Whitehall, alongside
OL,9,Fabout 20 World War Two veterans
OL,11,F"I think it will be a very emotional
OL,12,Fday," says 103-year-old Annie Duplock,
OL,13,Fwho was a Land Girl during WW2
OL,15,FAndy Burnham will be joined by former
OL,16,FPMs including Boris Johnson, Tony Blair
OL,17,Fand John Major
OL,19,FAway from the capital, services will
OL,20,Falso take place in communities across
OL,21,Fthe UK, including in Edinburgh, Belfast
OL,22,Fand Cardiff
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
